@host = http://localhost:5000
@jwtToken = YOUR_LEADGROWTH_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 0. Health / Meta Integration Status Check
GET {{host}}/api/meta/status
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### =========================================================================
### PART A: CAMPAIGNS, ADSETS & INSIGHTS (Uses User Access Token)
### =========================================================================

### 1. List Campaigns from Meta Ad Account
GET {{host}}/api/meta/campaigns
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### 2. Create Campaign on Meta
POST {{host}}/api/meta/campaigns
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Hoossh Leads Launch Campaign",
  "objective": "OUTCOME_LEADS",
  "status": "PAUSED",
  "specialAdCategories": ["NONE"],
  "isAdsetBudgetSharingEnabled": false,
  "dailyBudget": 500.00
}

### 3. Create Ad Set under Campaign
POST {{host}}/api/meta/adsets
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Hoossh Real Estate - US 25-55",
  "campaignId": "YOUR_META_CAMPAIGN_ID_HERE",
  "dailyBudget": 1000,
  "billingEvent": "IMPRESSIONS",
  "optimizationGoal": "LEAD_GENERATION",
  "targetCountries": ["US"],
  "ageMin": 25,
  "ageMax": 55,
  "status": "PAUSED"
}

### 4. Get Campaign Insights (Summary)
GET {{host}}/api/meta/campaigns/YOUR_META_CAMPAIGN_ID_HERE/insights
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### 5. Get Campaign Insights with Daily Breakdown (Chart / Trends)
GET {{host}}/api/meta/campaigns/YOUR_META_CAMPAIGN_ID_HERE/insights?dailyTrend=true&datePreset=last_30d
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}


### =========================================================================
### PART B: LEAD ADS & FORMS (Uses Page Access Token)
### =========================================================================

### 6. List Lead Forms for Page
GET {{host}}/api/meta/forms
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### 7. Create a Lead Generation Form on Meta
POST {{host}}/api/meta/forms
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Hoossh Instant Lead Capture Form",
  "followUpActionUrl": "https://hoossh.com",
  "questions": ["FULL_NAME", "EMAIL", "PHONE"],
  "privacyPolicyUrl": "https://hoossh.com/privacy",
  "privacyPolicyLinkText": "Privacy Policy"
}

### 8. Get Leads Captured by a Specific Lead Form
GET {{host}}/api/meta/forms/YOUR_FORM_ID_HERE/leads
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### 9. Get Page Access Token from Business Manager owned pages
GET {{host}}/api/meta/page-token?businessManagerId=YOUR_BM_ID&pageId=1391100724075709
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}


### =========================================================================
### FULL SYNC & PERSISTENCE
### =========================================================================

### 10. Trigger Manual Full Meta Sync for Current Workspace
POST {{host}}/api/meta/sync
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
